# Love INC Mobile App - Cursor Rules

## Color Management

**IMPORTANT: Always use CSS variables from `variables.scss` instead of hardcoded colors.**

### Color Variables Available:
- `var(--ion-color-primary)` - Primary brand color
- `var(--ion-color-secondary)` - Secondary brand color
- `var(--ion-color-dark)` - Dark text/backgrounds
- `var(--ion-color-light)` - Light backgrounds (#f4f5f8)
- `var(--ion-color-medium)` - Medium gray for secondary text
- `var(--ion-color-primary-contrast)` - White/contrast color for primary
- `var(--ion-color-dark-rgb)` - RGB values for rgba() usage
- `var(--ion-color-light-rgb)` - RGB values for rgba() usage
- `var(--love-inc-teal)`, `var(--love-inc-blue)`, etc. - Brand colors

### Common Color Mappings:
- `#ffffff` / `#fff` / `white` → `var(--ion-background-color)` or `var(--ion-color-primary-contrast)`
- `#000000` / `#000` / `black` → `var(--ion-color-dark)`
- `#f4f5f8` → `var(--ion-color-light)`
- `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)` → `rgba(var(--ion-color-dark-rgb), 0.5)`
- `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)` → `rgba(var(--ion-color-primary-contrast-rgb), 0.2)`

### When Adding New Colors:
1. Add the color to `src/theme/variables.scss` first
2. Use the variable in component SCSS files
3. Never hardcode hex, rgb, or named colors directly in component files

## Icon Management

All icons should be imported in `src/app/app.component.ts` for app-wide availability. Do not import icons in individual components.

## Whitespace Management

**CRITICAL: Always use whitespace utility classes from `whitespace.scss` instead of creating custom margin/padding styles.**

### Available Whitespace Utilities:

**Margins:**
- `.m-{size}` - Margin on all sides (3, 6, 12, 18, 24, 30, 36, 42, 48)
- `.m-t-{size}` - Margin top
- `.m-b-{size}` - Margin bottom
- `.m-l-{size}` - Margin left
- `.m-r-{size}` - Margin right

**Padding:**
- `.p-{size}` - Padding on all sides (3, 6, 12, 18, 24, 30, 36, 42, 48)
- `.p-t-{size}` - Padding top
- `.p-b-{size}` - Padding bottom
- `.p-l-{size}` - Padding left
- `.p-r-{size}` - Padding right

### Examples:
```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT: Use utility classes -->
<div class="m-b-24">Content</div>
<p class="p-18">Text with padding</p>
<section class="m-t-12 m-b-36">Section</section>

<!-- ❌ WRONG: Don't create custom CSS -->
<div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Content</div>
```

### When to Use:
- **ALWAYS** use whitespace utilities for spacing between elements
- **NEVER** create custom margin/padding styles in component SCSS files
- **ONLY** create custom spacing if you need a value not in the scale (3, 6, 12, 18, 24, 30, 36, 42, 48)

### Benefits:
- Consistent spacing throughout the app
- Faster development (no need to write CSS)
- Easier maintenance (change spacing scale in one place)
- Better performance (utility classes are optimized)

## Theme File Organization

All theme files are imported in `src/global.scss`:
- `variables.scss` - CSS variables and color definitions
- `typography.scss` - Font sizes, weights, line heights
- `cards.scss` - Card component styles
- `icons.scss` - Icon styles for all icon types
- `whitespace.scss` - Margin and padding utility classes
